        "body": [{ "cells": [
          { "children": [{ "type": "paragraph", "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "textAlign": "center", "value": "HIGH" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#edb2ad", "padding": 3 } },
          { "children": [{ "type": "heading", "level": 3, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 10.5, "value": "Finding F-01 — Shared privileged account on integration middleware" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#f5f7f9", "padding": 3, "borderLeft": { "color": "#9b3f35", "width": 2 } } }
        ] }]
      },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Observation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "The nightly integration layer between Oracle Retail and Workday uses one shared administrator account (SVC_INTADM). At least seven engineers know the password; it is stored in a team OneNote page and was last rotated in November 2024. Logs record only the account name, so individual actions cannot be attributed. During fieldwork, the account was used interactively to modify a production mapping table without a change ticket." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Risk" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Unattributable privileged activity defeats segregation-of-duties monitoring over the financial data pipeline. An erroneous or malicious mapping change could misstate revenue or inventory in Workday with no forensic trail, while the shared credential widens the impact of a compromised workstation." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Recommendation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Replace interactive use of SVC_INTADM with named accounts brokered through privileged access management (PAM); make the service account non-interactive with a vault-managed, auto-rotated credential; and record all middleware administration sessions." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Management response" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Agreed. Project Sentinel will accelerate PAM onboarding. Interactive SVC_INTADM logons will be disabled by August 14, named-account brokering live by September 18, and session recording enabled by September 30. Owner: Head of Integration Services. Due: September 30, 2026." },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "style": { "marginTop": 6 },
        "columns": [{ "width": "10%" }, { "width": "90%" }],
        "body": [{ "cells": [
          { "children": [{ "type": "paragraph", "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 8.5, "textAlign": "center", "value": "MEDIUM" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#f2d39b", "padding": 3 } },
          { "children": [{ "type": "heading", "level": 3, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 10.5, "value": "Finding F-02 — Leaver access revocation outside SLA" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#f5f7f9", "padding": 3, "borderLeft": { "color": "#a66a16", "width": 2 } } }
        ] }]
      },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Observation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Group policy requires logical access to be revoked within one business day of an employee's leaving date. For 9 of 45 leavers sampled between January and April 2026, at least one in-scope account remained active beyond the SLA; the longest exception was 26 calendar days for a store-operations analyst with Oracle Retail read access. None of the nine accounts showed post-termination logon activity." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Risk" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Dormant former-employee accounts are a common initial-access vector and may breach the group's ISO 27001 commitments (control A.5.18). Single sign-on deactivation partially mitigated impact by blocking interactive access for 7 of the 9 exceptions." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Recommendation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Extend the HR-to-IAM feed to both directly provisioned legacy systems, automate revocation, and add a daily service-desk reconciliation report." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Management response" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Agreed. Owner: IT Service Delivery Manager. Due: October 31, 2026." },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "style": { "marginTop": 6 },
        "columns": [{ "width": "10%" }, { "width": "90%" }],
        "body": [{ "cells": [
          { "children": [{ "type": "paragraph", "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 8.5, "textAlign": "center", "value": "MEDIUM" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#f2d39b", "padding": 3 } },
          { "children": [{ "type": "heading", "level": 3, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 10.5, "value": "Finding F-03 — Backup restoration testing gaps" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#f5f7f9", "padding": 3, "borderLeft": { "color": "#a66a16", "width": 2 } } }
        ] }]
      },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Observation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Restoration tests were not performed within the required 12-month cycle for two of six tier-1 databases: the Oracle Retail price-management schema and the integration staging database." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Risk" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Backup jobs completed with a 99.4% success rate, but untested backups provide limited recovery assurance." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Recommendation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Complete both restoration tests and add the evidence to the monthly infrastructure KPI pack." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Management response" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Agreed. Tests are scheduled by August 28 and KPI evidence begins in September. Owner: Head of Infrastructure. Due: November 30, 2026 (full cycle re-baseline)." },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "style": { "marginTop": 6 },
        "columns": [{ "width": "10%" }, { "width": "90%" }],
        "body": [{ "cells": [
          { "children": [{ "type": "paragraph", "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "textAlign": "center", "value": "LOW" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#b9ddbd", "padding": 3 } },
          { "children": [{ "type": "heading", "level": 3, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 10.5, "value": "Finding F-04 — Emergency change retrospective approvals" }], "style": { "backgroundColor": "#f5f7f9", "padding": 3, "borderLeft": { "color": "#3f7647", "width": 2 } } }
        ] }]
      },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Observation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Three of 28 sampled emergency changes lacked the retrospective CAB approval required within five business days; all three had valid incident references and peer-reviewed implementation notes." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Risk" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "The required approval evidence was incomplete even though incident and peer-review records were present." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Recommendation" },
      { "type": "paragraph", "fontSize": 9, "lineHeight": 1.2, "style": { "marginRight": 60 }, "value": "Configure the change-management tool to auto-escalate unapproved emergency records after three days." },
      { "type": "heading", "level": 5, "font": "Helvetica-Bold", "fontSize": 9, "style": { "marginTop": 1 }, "value": "Management response" },
